  "limitations": [
    "This archive is independent source-queue research only. Six Heineken-related public stage images and three Samsung Dreamfold images remain in separate original directories. There are no models, render tasks, production scene deliverables or new-scene counts; neither queue is accepted or ready for complete-scene reconstruction.",
    "The supplied2023-01-04 secondary report associates Xingtong and Xing Yin Li with Heineken. The earlier preview associates Wei Yi with Samsung Dreamfold. Official performance-pixel identity has not been established for Heineken; the earlier lineup omission does not prove nonappearance. Samsung Wei Yi material cannot be used to bridge Heineken. The archive worker preserves these reported claims without independently re-browsing or settling their conflict.",
    "Heineken remains short of a second complete unobstructed wide side/high view of a demonstrably same version. Near-front images, cropped seating and the two-panel identity collage do not supply that baseline. The requested original heineken-2 stage image itself includes an interactive treasure-box UI; it is retained unchanged and distinguished from YOUKU broadcast screenshots. No unrelated UI/social capture is added, and interactive/video versions are not merged as one same-state geometry.",
    "Samsung Dreamfold has only one full wide view (reta2-8); reta2-7 is a phone-side partial view and reta2-9 is a moving-blimp/phone partial view. The reported performer/lyrics/preview link is stronger than a brand name alone, but is not a native official clip/time bridge. Blimps, hearts, glow and screen video are not fixed geometric landmarks. Missing phone hinge/support, screen-foot and terrain side evidence remains explicit.",
    "All nine public images are non-native media references with unknown precise clip times and unverified highest decode quality. Publication dates are not substituted for performance/frame timestamps. No image is resized, renamed by guessed format, recaptured, edited or used to fabricate geometry during archival.",
    "Supplied deduplication is bounded: the reports describe source-panel comparisons with old Issue6 and Issue90 plus a29-record text snapshot, not exhaustive current repository pixel deduplication. Two referenced old comparison images are outside this23-file freeze: old-neon-Reference_B_crop.jpg and old-festival-three-source-comparison-derived.jpg. Their recorded hashes and citations are preserved, but their bytes are not claimed included or independently inspected by this archive worker. No missing research attachment is fetched or reconstructed.",
    "The initial62d4541 commit and successor6577e24 commit are preserved unchanged. Thirteen of the initial14 files remain byte-identical; only the root README changes and nine Dreamfold files are appended. Source manifests, both scoped tree manifests and the included-image QA hash/dimension records are checked against actual archived bytes. The earlier Heineken review and updated identity/version limitations remain intact.",
    "A new independent archive branch is based on the unchanged verified redwhite archive commit solely to preserve all12024 old paths. Every210 preexisting advertised ref, including main, HEAD, managed PR refs and all scene/research refs, remains unchanged. Only two new archive/history branches are created by ordinary Git; all source objects and both commit trees are verified from a fresh independent remote repository.",
    "This is distinct from the denied source-screening-increment receipt, which remains paused and is never retried. No modeling/rendering, production tree edits, LFS, force pushes, history deletion, credential copying, security changes, Issues or PRs. Library version1 remains retained, and consumption confirmation is given only after the new verification receipt is committed and independently read back. No permanent attachment is created or modified."
  ],
